  "description": "VUVLAB crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C79 H117 N4 O27 Tb5,3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.537-3.649 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.17-97.96°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C79H123N4O30Tb5. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
